[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0010","text":"啊……\n摩美美？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0020","text":"真的耶！\n小美美——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0030","text":"咦？　走掉了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0040","text":"……是我看错了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0050","text":"不、把小美美看错什么的——\n诶，不会吧？　是小美美没错吧……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0052","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0060","text":"叫我？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0070","text":"摩美美……！／小美美……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0080","text":"刚、刚才你不是在那边吗！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0090","text":"呀，不在哦——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0100","text":"那，果然\n是我看错了吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30600300_01_0102","text":"Motion"}]
